 "model": {
  "balance": "each cell i: V_i dc_i/dt = G_eq,i (u_i - c_i) + sum over its junctions of G_GJ (c_j - c_i) + sum over its probes of G_probe (h_p - c_i), with G_eq,i = size_i G_eq,1 and V_i = size_i V_1: the preprint's equation 1 with generation K_dec u_i and decay K_dec, and its junctions (Fick, no drift)",
  "steady_state": "the concentrations at which every cell's right side is zero",
  "chain": "a straight chain of n equal cells, every junction G_GJ = G_eq,1, unloaded 1, sealed at its first cell and seen from its last (the port): its steady port concentration is u_n - i_exit / G_eq,n (the preprint's Figure 8), where i_exit leaves the port; g_eq_ratio is G_eq,n / G_eq,1 and intercept is u_n",
  "units": "concentrations in the preprint's [mR] units; conductances in units of G_eq,1 = V_1 K_dec; size is a cell's volume in units of V_1"
 },
